[14145]="7000EC02\n1\tDefeat Morningthaw bears (total: 15)\tMorningthaw bears can be found around Tírith Rhaw in the Ettenmoors. Soldier Búzog asked you to defeat Morningthaw bears in the Ettenmoors.\n2\tTalk to Soldier Búzog\tSoldier Búzog is at Gramsfoot in the Ettenmoors. You should tell Soldier Búzog that the bears are no longer a hindrance to the construction of the barricades.\n",
[14146]="70044117\n1\tDisarm the Enemy's casks in the cisterns and defeat the Morgul forces Defeating the Morgul Captain will end this quest\tMorgul-orcs and goblins have snuck into the cisterns beneath Minas Tirith, hoping to destroy it from below while the forces of Gondor are occupied upon the wall.\n",
[14147]="7003FF7E\n1\tPreserve records (total: 4)\tThe records must be preserved if debts and ownership is to be known.\n",
[14148]="70066A48\n1\tUpokhir has asked you to deliver plans to his trusted confidants in Pahor Boha. Pahor Boha can be found in the south-east of Pinnath Gelin.\t\n2\tTalk to Upokhir\tYou to have delivered plans to Upokhir's trusted confidants within Pahor Boha, and should report your success. Talk to Upokhir in Ost Arndír.\n",
[14149]="70042E89\n1\tSearch for Mírthel\tOst Sarram is located upon the southern cliffs in the western side of Southern Ithilien. You should search for Mírthel near Ost Sarram.\n2\tSpeak with Mírthel\tOst Sarram is located upon the southern cliffs in the western side of Southern Ithilien. You should talk to Mírthel near Ost Sarram.\n3\tDestroy Haradrim ladders (total: 6)\tOst Sarram is located upon the southern cliffs in the western side of Southern Ithilien. You should destroy Haradrim ladders upon the cliffs to stop the flow of men and supplies.\n4\tSpeak with Mírthel\tOst Sarram is located upon the southern cliffs in the western side of Southern Ithilien. You should speak to Mírthel near Ost Sarram.\n",
[14150]="70019D3C\n1\tColoca la flecha de venganza en la base del árbol solitario\tEl árbol solitario donde Núrelleth quiere que se coloque la flecha de venganza se encuentra en la orilla del Anduin, al este de Imlad Lalaith. Núrelleth quiere que los Elfos de Lothlórien recuerden a su marido Faengris, y para eso, preferiría que la flecha de venganza se mantuviera en su memoria en lugar de ser usada para matar a más Orcos.\n2\tHabla con Núrelleth en Telain Glorelloth\tNúrelleth está en Telain Glorelloth, en uno de los flets que se extiende sobre la cerca que rodea Caras Galadhon. Has dejado la flecha de venganza en el árbol solitario como Núrelleth te lo pidió y ahora deberías regresar a ella.\n",
[14151]="70068ABF\n1\tWash your hands in the wash-basin\tRenowned head-cook Brûdo needs help catering a party for Umbar's elite. Start by washing your hands. A hand-washing basin can be found near Brûdo.\n2\tTalk to Brûdo\tNow that your hands are clean, speak to Brûdo to receive instructions. Brûdo can be found at the bath-house in the Upper Ward.\n3\tCarry the tray of food to table three\tNow that your hands are clean, pick up the first tray of food and take it to table three. The tray of food is on the table next to Brûdo.\n4\tTalk to Brûdo\tYou have made your first delivery. Speak to Brûdo to learn what to do next. Brûdo can be found at the bath-house in the Upper Ward.\n5\tClean up dirty dishes (total: 4)\tBrûdo told you to clean the dishes off tables four, five, six, and seven, near the dancing man. Brûdo still needs your help in the Upper Ward.\n6\tBring the dirty dishes to Brûdo\tYou have gathered the soiled plates. Bring them to Brûdo. Brûdo can be found in the bath-house of the Upper Ward.\n7\tDeliver the semolina cake to the guest\tBrûdo has asked you to deliver a special semolina cake to a guest. Brûdo can be found at the bath-house in the Upper Ward.\n8\tTalk to Brûdo\tYou have completed all your tasks and should speak to Brûdo. Brûdo can be found at the bath-house in the Upper Ward.\n",
[14152]="7002741D\n1\tDerrota invasores del Clan del Dragón (total: 12)\tPuedes encontrar invasores del Clan del Dragón por todas las Tierras del Rebaño. Debes derrotar a los invasores del Clan del Dragón mientras recorres las tierras de cultivo.\n2\tRegresa con Blodwen en las Tierras del Rebaño\tPuedes encontrar a Blodwen escondida entre las rocas en el extremo sur de las Tierras del Rebaño en Fuerte Dreng. Debes volver con Blodwen y ver si aún necesita tu ayuda.\n",
[14153]="7004D370\n1\tDefeat Urdâr\tUrdâr can be found patrolling the Dale-lands. You have encountered the aggressive Urdâr. Roaming on the outskirts of the Dale-lands, the evil man patrols with his pets.\n2\tDefeat Urdâr\tUrdâr can be found patrolling the Dale-lands. You have encountered the aggressive Urdâr. Roaming on the outskirts of the Dale-lands, the evil man patrols with his pets.\n3\tCompletado\tYou have defeated Urdâr.\n",
[14154]="70043DAA\n1\tLleva el suministro a Arthon rápidamente\tArthon se encuentra en la Armería. Debes llevarle el suministro a Arthon. Esta etapa incluye condiciones de fallo; revisa el diario antes de elegir objetos o acciones.\n",
[14155]="70054F03\n1\tCollect rune-inscribed urns at Aufaltor\tRune-inscribed urns can be found at Aufaltor in Thuringwath.\n2\tCollect rune-inscribed urns at Aufaltor (total: 8)\tRune-inscribed urns can be found at Aufaltor in Thuringwath. You have discovered numerous urns bearing runic inscriptions in Aufaltor. You should collect a number of them for Mithrandir.\n3\tCompletado\tYou have collected many rune-inscribed urns at Aufaltor.\n",
[14156]="70054808\n1\tDestroy tents at Urshúlagar\tUrshúlagar can be found in Emyn Duir. You should destroy tents at Urshúlagar.\n2\tDestroy tents at Urshúlagar (total: 10)\tUrshúlagar can be found in Emyn Duir. You should destroy tents at Urshúlagar.\n3\tCompletado\tDestroyed many tents at Urshúlagar.\n",
[14157]="70054807\n1\tDefeat evil Men at Urshúlagar\tUrshúlagar can be found in Emyn Duir. You should defeat any evil Men you find at Urshúlagar.\n2\tDefeat Easterlings at Urshúlagar (total: 10)\030Defeat Black Númenóreans at Urshúlagar (total: 6)\tUrshúlagar can be found in Emyn Duir. You should defeat evil Men at Urshúlagar.\n3\tCompletado\tDefeated many evil Men at Urshúlagar.\n",
[14158]="7001AB9A\n1\tRecoge collares uruk (total: 6)\tLos uruks pueden encontrarse en Sâd-en-Dagor, en Dol Guldur, al noreste de Helethir. Stirnir te ha pedido que recojas collares de los uruks en Dol Guldur.\n",
[14159]="7005025F\n1\tDefeat Jangovar in Utterby (total: 20)\030Defeat stubborn Jangovar lords (total: 3)\tMany Jangovar can be found inside Utterby. You should defeat Jangovar outside Utterby and inside Utterby: Continue the Fight.\n2\tHabla con Náin\tLord Náin can be found inside of the gates in Utterby. You should talk to Lord Náin.\n",
[14160]="70058F70\n1\tHabla con Wenda Cranesbill\tHabla con Wenda para aceptar su amable oferta.\n",
